UNIT may_join
KIND FUNCTIONAL
ORACLE-CLASS deterministic
FIDELITY spec
ANCHOR this server's join page limit, set by the server's owner on 2026-11-17 ("100 per hour")
SIG may_join(tries_still_counted: i64) -> bool
ENVELOPE tries_still_counted is any whole number, 0 or more.
DEPENDS-ON none
DESCRIPTION Whether an address that has made this many tries that still count may try to join once more.
BEHAVIOR
R1 The answer is true when tries_still_counted is less than MAX_TRIES, and false otherwise. So the try that makes MAX_TRIES is allowed, and the one after it is not.
PINNED const MAX_TRIES = 100 CITED assumption the server's owner 2026-11-17: "100 per hour"
